WEBVTT

00:05.500 --> 00:08.500
"Pituca, can you move the arm?"

00:08.500 --> 00:19.600
Agent: Yes. I just moved the arm to the rest position with the gripper open.

00:19.600 --> 00:26.700
Agent: Tell me where you want it to go, or what to pick up.

00:26.700 --> 00:40.800
"Pituca, I want you to move the arm up."

00:40.800 --> 00:46.100
Agent: Done, I've stretched the arm upward.

00:52.100 --> 00:59.100
"Pituca, now go back to home."

00:59.100 --> 01:09.200
Agent: I'm back at home with the gripper open.

01:12.200 --> 01:28.600
"Close, Pituca, close the gripper."

01:28.600 --> 01:30.600
Agent: Gripper closed.
